00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.770
Amazing baby, has the best personality.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:56.603
Laughing all day.

00:00:56.603 --> 00:00:58.699
Super curious.

00:00:58.699 --> 00:01:00.120
Yeah. But it's terrifying

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.650
